						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ad2e329" data-id="ad2e329" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-99ff1a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="99ff1a4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Midwest Tropical is one of the most reputable companies in the water features industry, boasting a remarkable track record of excellence in client satisfaction. Our journey first began in the 1970s, and for the past five decades, we have consistently delivered high-quality and bespoke solutions tailored to each client’s specific preferences.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c18edbd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c18edbd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Our extensive experience in the field has allowed us to gain a profound understanding of our clients’ needs, giving us an exceptional insight into creating fully sealed water walls, bubble tubes, and bubble walls that require minimal upkeep while offering an enchanting water feature experience. We offer a comprehensive range of unique indoor water features, such as fountains, rain curtains, bubble walls, reflection pools, and more.</p>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-706ed81" data-id="706ed81" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8941c50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8941c50" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>We pride ourselves on our state-of-the-art manufacturing facility, which produces some of the highest-quality products in the industry. Our water features are fully sealed and enclosed to keep out any external contaminants, ensuring that they remain effortless to maintain.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6116a7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6116a7e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Moreover, we provide design and installation services nationwide, enabling you to transform your living or office space into the luxurious haven you deserve. We are committed to providing excellent customer service and are always ready to offer a quote upon request. Get in touch with us today to upgrade your property with one of our exceptional water features and experience true relaxation.</p>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5706ef9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="5706ef9" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d24cef6" data-id="d24cef6" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-05b69b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="05b69b5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2>Open Water Features, Fountains and Pools</h2><p>The sound of trickling water adds a sense of calm to a space. Many of our custom indoor water features are open designs that allow both the look and the sound of water into your space. With Midwest Tropical, you can enjoy:</p><ul><li><a href="/waterwalls/">Water walls</a></li><li>Indoor waterfalls</li><li><a href="/bubble-walls/">Bubble walls</a></li><li><a href="/bubble-tubes/">Bubble tubes</a></li><li><a href="/rain-curtains/">Rain curtains</a></li><li><a href="/water-displays/">Water displays</a></li><li>Custom fountains</li><li><a href="/reflection-pools/">Pools and reflection pools</a></li></ul><p>No matter which of these designs is the right fit for your space, when you choose Midwest Tropical as your partner to design and build it, you will receive a custom look that is uniquely yours, helping your property stand out. To see examples from past projects, visit our online gallery.</p><h2>Custom-Created Water Features for Your Facility</h2><p>Midwest Tropical creates all of our indoor waterfalls, water walls, rain curtains, fountains, bubble walls and other water features in-house at our design and manufacturing facility located in the Chicago area. Because our water feature designers and manufacturers work closely together, our water features are the highest-quality designs in the world. We use stainless steel, copper and other metals alongside glass, acrylic, stone, tile, slate and more. With this long list of materials at our disposal, and the skill of our in-house designers, we can customize the design until it fully fits your inspiration. Our turnkey installation and design services are available throughout the United States.</p>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6e8a6aa" data-id="6e8a6aa" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4b82531 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="4b82531" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
